#
# CHANNELD.INIT - CHANNEL MASTER INIT FILE
#
# To create a new channel:
# <name>:<recv>:<send>:<flags>:<info>:<master>
#

# Due to emergency troll prevention (some guests seem to stick 
# to a highly questionable ideology), D-chat and Intermud "send" 
# only if playerlevel >= 2.
# -Anatol, 12.08.2012


